    {
      "id": "OqfFSWwRybxDnpb3pV1Go",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 194.1873479844242,
      "y": -729.3959964812816,
      "width": 506.57568359375,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "K1AjLeo80CORdSynxl3tV",
      "index": "c2QV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1230124024,
      "version": 487,
      "versionNonce": 511759496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752396815928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VPC Endpoint를 활용하여 S3 객체 Application VPC만을 거쳐 다운로드\n2 VPC 내 모든 트래픽 CloudWatch 로그 그룹에 저장\n  ❍ ws25-hub-vpc : /ws25/flow/hub\n  ❍ ws25-app-vpc : /ws25/flow/app\nBastionEC2가 배치될 퍼블릭 서브넷에서 RDS 접근 가능하도록\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VPC Endpoint를 활용하여 S3 객체 Application VPC만을 거쳐 다운로드\n2 VPC 내 모든 트래픽 CloudWatch 로그 그룹에 저장\n  ❍ ws25-hub-vpc : /ws25/flow/hub\n  ❍ ws25-app-vpc : /ws25/flow/app\nBastionEC2가 배치될 퍼블릭 서브넷에서 RDS 접근 가능하도록\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XjFf2KYgI3pfxX5GU9Jdt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 938.1805406650308,
      "y": -109.02788858161466,
      "width": 389.0396728515625,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "K1AjLeo80CORdSynxl3tV",
      "index": "c2QY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1919555320,
      "version": 602,
      "versionNonce": 126157704,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752396815928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Golang Applications\nGreen\nRed\nv1.0.0 -> v1.0.1\n-h 바이너리 실행 도움\nExternal Secret -> Secrets Manager\nIRSA\nSecret Store CSI Driver로 Secrets Manager 마운트",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Golang Applications\nGreen\nRed\nv1.0.0 -> v1.0.1\n-h 바이너리 실행 도움\nExternal Secret -> Secrets Manager\nIRSA\nSecret Store CSI Driver로 Secrets Manager 마운트",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pglyRGe7nCIDd4KRf37QU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1476.6385538382522,
      "y": 210.95916616033946,
      "width": 533.3275146484375,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "K1AjLeo80CORdSynxl3tV",
      "index": "c2Qa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1989851384,
      "version": 653,
      "versionNonce": 1043026568,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752396815928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Green/Red App은 DB 환경변수를 읽어 RDS 연결 \nDB_USER\nDB_PASSWORD\nDB_URL\nApplication Secrets Manger Name: gj2025-eks-cluster-catalog-secret\nGitHub AccessToken Secrets Manager Name: gj2025-github-token",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Green/Red App은 DB 환경변수를 읽어 RDS 연결 \nDB_USER\nDB_PASSWORD\nDB_URL\nApplication Secrets Manger Name: gj2025-eks-cluster-catalog-secret\nGitHub AccessToken Secrets Manager Name: gj2025-github-token",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
