      "versionNonce": 103033848,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752396815928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GitHub \"gj2025-repository\"\n- red / green\n- Dockerfile\n- buildspec.yaml\nCodePipeline 소스 작업 외 모든 작업은\nGitHub AccessToken을 사용해 자격증명\n\"gj2025-repository\"는 /home/ec2-user/에 위치, ec2-user로 git push\n- Red Application app Branch: app-red\n- Red Application gitops Branch: gitops-red\n- Green Application app Branch: app-green\n- Green Application gitops Branch: gitops-green",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GitHub \"gj2025-repository\"\n- red / green\n- Dockerfile\n- buildspec.yaml\nCodePipeline 소스 작업 외 모든 작업은\nGitHub AccessToken을 사용해 자격증명\n\"gj2025-repository\"는 /home/ec2-user/에 위치, ec2-user로 git push\n- Red Application app Branch: app-red\n- Red Application gitops Branch: gitops-red\n- Green Application app Branch: app-green\n- Green Application gitops Branch: gitops-green",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
